{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OIO4qJojVl1795082065.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[16:15]</p><p>天文台：受強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，本港今晚及明日天氣顯著轉涼。由於密雲及有幾陣雨，明日日間氣溫將繼續下降，加上風寒效應，市民特別是進行戶外活動的人士請留意天氣變化，注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.242720+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.821519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.370343+00:00","content_hash":"1becdfcb1b9a14af69657aad45cfc1e4b170664fc80cecad8efa7fc70f4f5b79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.242720+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}